00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:11,800
is to gain those small advantages each day.

266
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:15,800
The little steps it takes to build up to success.

267
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,800
Principle number three.

268
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,800
Success is a pleasure.

